==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*5 [[Devil Wife|Devil Wives]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*4 [[Aku Gory|Aku Gories]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
*3 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
*2 [[R.Ost]]s spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*1 [[THE SLOTH]] spawns as the boss after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.

==Strategy==
[[Courier Cat]] will make quick work of the red enemies on this stage.

If you have them, you can use either [[Maize Cat (Rare Cat)|Cone Cat]] or [[Ancient Egg: N003 (Special Cat)|Cat Cactus]] to stall the [[Aku Gory|Aku Gories]] and [[Devil Wife|Devil Wives]] on this stage. Though for that purpose, [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Eraser Cat]] will work just fine too. They can then be killed with units such as [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]], [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Seafarer Cat]], and other units that outrange them and do high damage.

